{"ready":true,"data":{"id":"amanda-walker","name":"Amanda Walker","birthDate":"1935-11-29","birthPlace":"Glasgow, Scotland, UK","bio":"Amanda Walker (born 29 November 1935, Glasgow, Scotland) is a British actress, daughter of actress Madeleine Christie, who has appeared in over 100 productions since 1959. In film, she has appeared in Heat and Dust (1983), A Room with a View (1986), The English Patient (1996), Cloud Atlas (2012), and Triangle of Sadness (2022). On television she has had roles in Upstairs, Downstairs, Agatha Christie's Poirot, Sense8 (2017–2018), and Doctor Who (2024). She is married to actor Patrick Godfrey (m. 1960); they have two children.","source":"TMDB","fetchedAt":"2026-11-19T17:34:47+00:00","tmdbId":108620,"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/person/108620","credits":[{"id":"cap-first","title":"Captain America: The First Avenger","character":"Antique Store Owner"}],"photo":"./public-data/images/people/amanda-walker.webp","filmography":[{"name":"Rejoyce!","year":2024,"character":"Winifred Joyce","mediaType":"movie","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/gSOWac8jqImq3IMCWBiklLoN2G8.jpg"},{"name":"Doctor Who","year":2024,"character":"Old Ruby","mediaType":"tv","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/2JP6NSmBwxg75uTcIHiv5R8PpPi.jpg"},{"name":"Triangle of Sadness","year":2022,"character":"Clementine","mediaType":"movie","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/k9eLozCgCed5FGTSdHu0bBElAV8.jpg"},{"name":"The Best Offer","year":2013,"character":"Owner","mediaType":"movie","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/ibDGPgUZn6vxHiSgt2xeQyFp8Np.jpg"},{"name":"Cloud Atlas","year":2012,"character":"Veronica","mediaType":"movie","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/8naVv2Xu3rWI5JKHz0vCujx6GaJ.jpg"},{"name":"Captain America: The First Avenger","year":2011,"character":"Antique Store Owner","mediaType":"movie","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/vSNxAJTlD0r02V9sPYpOjqDZXUK.jpg"},{"name":"Bad Night for the Blues","year":2010,"character":"Eliz